---
description: REMI proof-of-concept product and engineering boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and the documents it references before changing code.

Implement only the current branch's component from `docs/ROADMAP.md`. The stable REMI foundation is a private owner/friend application that manually sends one MP4 plus one question to Gemini and returns a validated critique.

During the manual-analyser and research-grounding phases, do not add persistence, Meta integration, old-Reel imports, Insights, creator history, secondary models, virality prediction or unrelated creator tools. Deterministic preprocessing belongs only to its named visual-timing or audio-friction PR.

Preserve the critic-only direction: no confidence scores, creative fixes or unsolicited script/content criticism. The stable code still has legacy solution and confidence fields until `feat/critique-only-contract` changes the prompt, schema, interface and tests together.

Protect unpublished videos, enforce access on the analysis route itself, and keep all credentials exclusively server-side.

After meaningful changes, run the relevant lint, type-check and test commands and report their outcomes.
